<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, as the fountain You’d want us to drink,</l><l>Always supplying, it’s my only link,</l><l>Staying connected to this precious flow,</l><l>Planting my roots here that they would grow.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>You are the Potter, we are the clay,</l><l>Form now the church, Your expression today,</l><l>In Christ there’s nothing that we may lack,</l><l>As now Your Body, we’d bring You back.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
